# ============================
# TRACKED FILES (DO NOT IGNORE)
# ============================
# The following are explicitly NOT ignored:
# - .env.example (template for environment variables)
# - README.md
# - AGENTS.md
# - TECH_LEARNING.md
# - tech-learning/ (all technology learning files)
# - docs/ (all documentation)
# - docs/TASKS.md
# - docs/PROJECT_PROGRESS.md
# - docs/PROJECT_MASTER_SPEC.md
# - docs/PRD.md
# - docs/DECISIONS.md
# - docs/RESEARCH.md
